{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"tf.raw_ops.MatrixSetDiag behaves differently between eager execution and XLA compilation when operating on a complex128 tensor produced by tf.raw_ops.SelfAdjointEigV2. However, when the same function is compiled with XLA using tf.function(..., jit_compile=True), compilation fails with an InvalidArgumentError:\n```\nInvalidArgumentError: Operands to select must be the same shape; got f64[4,4,32,32,32] and c128[4,4,32,32,32]. [[{{node MatrixSetDiag}}]]\n```\nHere is the [gist](https://colab.research.google.com/gist/jasminetrail/0758fba843a575554a87a925a525b3bd/issue.ipynb)\n\n# Minimal repo\n```python\nimport traceback\nimport tensorflow as tf\n\nprint(\"Tf version:\", tf.__version__)\ntf.random.set_seed(415)\nt23235 = tf.complex(tf.random.normal([4, 4, 32, 32, 32], dtype=tf.float64), tf.random.normal([4, 4, 32, 32, 32], dtype=tf.float64))\n\ndef model_415(t23235):\n    t23238 = tf.raw_ops.SelfAdjointEigV2(input=t23235, compute_v=True)[0]\n    t23239 = tf.raw_ops.MatrixSetDiag(input=t23235, diagonal=t23238)\n    return t23239\n\n_args = (t23235,)\n\nprint(\"=== EAGER ===\")\ntry:\n    eager_out = model_415(*_args)\n    print(\"Eager Output Succeeded\")\nexcept Exception:\n    print(traceback.format_exc())\n\nprint(\"\\n=== XLA ===\")\ntry:\n    xla_out = tf.function(model_415, jit_compile=True)(*_args)\n    print(\"Compiler Output Succeeded\")\nexcept Exception:\n    print(traceback.format_exc())\n```\n\n# Error logs\n```\nTf version: 2.22.0-dev20260921\n=== EAGER ===\nt23238 dtypr <dtype: 'complex128'>\nEager Output Succeeded\n\n=== XLA ===\nt23238 dtypr <dtype: 'complex128'>\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/ipykernel_3686/3586217713.py\", line 25, in <cell line: 0>\n    xla_out = tf.function(model_415, jit_compile=True)(*_args)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/tensorflow/python/util/traceback_utils.py\", line 167, in error_handler\n    raise e.with_traceback(filtered_tb) from None\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/tensorflow/python/eager/execute.py\", line 59, in quick_execute\n    except TypeError as e:\n    ...<5 lines>...\n      raise e\ntensorflow.python.framework.errors_impl.InvalidArgumentError: Operands to select must be the same shape; got f64[4,4,32,32,32] and c128[4,4,32,32,32].\n\t\n\nPython Code Location:\n  File: /usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/tensorflow/python/framework/ops.py:1275\n\t [[{{node MatrixSetDiag}}]]\n\ttf2xla conversion failed while converting __inference_model_415_636[_XlaMustCompile=true,config_proto=13561319589895757934,executor_type=11160318154034397263]. Run with TF_DUMP_GRAPH_PREFIX=/path/to/dump/dir and --vmodule=xla_compiler=2 to obtain a dump of the compiled functions. [Op:__inference_model_415_636]\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49334/comments","created_at":"2026-09-23T16:03:47Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49334/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/49334","id":5556060732,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":4409976544,"name":"bug","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABBtrm4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"7884fa","default":false,"description":"Runtime Error","id":8794528027,"name":"err: Runtime","node_id":"LA_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAACDDHZGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/labels/err:%20Runtime"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/49334/labels{/name}","locke